# valgrind.supp
#
# Suppressions for make memcheck. The machine code PCRE2's JIT makes (see
# sof_regex_jit()) reads the subject a word at a time, past its end within
# the same page, and discards the bytes that aren't the subject's; valgrind
# reports the branches on those bytes as depending on uninitialised values.
# The code has no object file, so valgrind names its frames "???"; nothing
# else in the tests runs from memory outside an object.
{
   pcre2-jit-reads-past-the-subject
   Memcheck:Cond
   obj:???
}
